<title>CANADA: TimberWest jumps on news it's for sale.</title>
<headline>TimberWest jumps on news it's for sale.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>TimberWest Forest Ltd stock soared Monday on the lumber company's announcement that it will seek a buyer.</p>
<p>TimberWest and its 52-percent owner, Fletcher Challenge Canada Ltd, announced they were putting TimberWest up for sale late Friday. New Zealand's Fletcher Challenge Ltd owns a majority of Fletcher Canada.</p>
<p>TimberWest shares were up 3 at 20. Fletcher Canada stock gained 0.75 to 20. Analysts said TimberWest is likely to attract interest from several forest companies active in British Columbia.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Vancouver Bureau (604) 664-7314</p>
</text>
